Q23. Create a class PrimeChecker with a method using local variables to check prime. Add a class variable totalPrimeChecks.

Program:

class PrimeChecker {
    static int totalPrimeChecks = 0;

    void check(int n) {
        boolean prime = n > 1;
        totalPrimeChecks++;

        for (int i = 2; i <= n / i; i++)
            if (n % i == 0) {
                prime = false;
                break;
            }

        System.out.println(prime ? "Prime" : "Not Prime");
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        PrimeChecker p = new PrimeChecker();
        p.check(7);
        System.out.println("Checks = " + totalPrimeChecks);
    }
}

